# Refactoring Walkthrough

Refactoring of the manga generation system scripts has been completed.

## Changes Made

### 1. Centralized Utilities ([manga_utils.py](file:///c:/Users/hirak/Desktop/2nd-Brain/18_%E3%83%AC%E3%83%9F%E6%8A%95%E8%B3%87%E6%BC%AB%E7%94%BB/%E3%83%9E%E3%83%B3%E3%82%AC%E3%83%8E/_system_scripts/manga_utils.py), [manga_config.py](file:///c:/Users/hirak/Desktop/2nd-Brain/18_%E3%83%AC%E3%83%9F%E6%8A%95%E8%B3%87%E6%BC%AB%E7%94%BB/%E3%83%9E%E3%83%B3%E3%82%AC%E3%83%8E/_system_scripts/manga_config.py))
- **[manga_utils.py](file:///c:/Users/hirak/Desktop/2nd-Brain/18_%E3%83%AC%E3%83%9F%E6%8A%95%E8%B3%87%E6%BC%AB%E7%94%BB/%E3%83%9E%E3%83%B3%E3%82%AC%E3%83%8E/_system_scripts/manga_utils.py)**: Added robust encoding detection (checking `utf-8`, `cp932`, `shift_jis`, `utf-8-sig` in order) to solve file reading issues on Windows. Added type hints and consistent error handling.
- **[manga_config.py](file:///c:/Users/hirak/Desktop/2nd-Brain/18_%E3%83%AC%E3%83%9F%E6%8A%95%E8%B3%87%E6%BC%AB%E7%94%BB/%E3%83%9E%E3%83%B3%E3%82%AC%E3%83%8E/_system_scripts/manga_config.py)**:
    - Replaced Unicode escape sequences (e.g., `\u9577...`) with readable Japanese text.
    - Updated `BASE_DIR` calculation to be relative to the script location, ensuring it works regardless of where the script is called from.

