## Next Steps
You can now run these scripts from `マンガノ/_system_scripts` using Python.
- `python generate_mangano.py`: Regenerates prompts/markdowns based on config.
- `python update_themes.py`: Updates keyword sections in story files.
- `python fix_manga_prompts.py`: Applies text replacements to story files.
